    {
      "id": "e86",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 688,
      "width": 352.96782056462735,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786230494547,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Everything downstream of the ATS is on\ngenerator. Everything downstream of the UPS rides\nthrough the 3–5 minutes before the generator picks\nup. Cooling must be on the generator or the room\ncooks while the UPS happily runs.",
      "originalText": "1. Everything downstream of the ATS is on generator. Everything downstream of the UPS rides through the 3–5 minutes before the generator picks up. Cooling must be on the generator or the room cooks while the UPS happily runs.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 935078982,
      "index": "b0N",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e87",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 777,
      "width": 357.04840572195707,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786230558738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. A/B is only real if the two paths are separate\nfrom the panel down. Two PDUs fed from one panel\nis theatre.",
      "originalText": "2. A/B is only real if the two paths are separate from the panel down. Two PDUs fed from one panel is theatre.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 785271834,
      "index": "b0O",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 356.6774434349269,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786230567989,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Wrap-around maintenance bypass is what makes a\nUPS concurrently maintainable. Without it you take\nan outage to change batteries.",
      "originalText": "3. Wrap-around maintenance bypass is what makes a UPS concurrently maintainable. Without it you take an outage to change batteries.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 684905094,
      "index": "b0P",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e89",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 883,
      "width": 352.59679714340376,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786230575079,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Size feeders on continuous load: conductor and\nOCPD at 125% of the continuous load (the '80%\nrule' seen from the other side).",
      "originalText": "4. Size feeders on continuous load: conductor and OCPD at 125% of the continuous load (the '80% rule' seen from the other side).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 91112154,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e90",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 941,
      "width": 354.8225708655836,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786230580099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Check UPS input current, not output. Double-\nconversion input at low load can carry meaningful\nharmonic content; specify input THDi and size the\ngenerator accordingly.",
      "originalText": "5. Check UPS input current, not output. Double-conversion input at low load can carry meaningful harmonic content; specify input THDi and size the generator accordingly.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
